WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.540
Four short sentences, two very common cases.

2
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.830
Nie mam czasu.

3
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.900
After a negated verb: the genitive.

4
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.190
Kawa bez cukru, proszę.

5
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.820
After without: the genitive again.

6
00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.030
Jestem na poczcie.

7
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.580
After on, for a place: the locative.

8
00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.990
Rozmawiamy o filmie.

9
00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.460
After about: the locative.

10
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.450
Idę do brata.

11
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:41.250
The genitive follows many short prepositions, negation and quantities.

12
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:50.720
The locative follows in, on, about and by, often with a change of consonant.

13
00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.880
You have no time. Say it.

14
00:00:58.380 --> 00:00:59.820
Nie mam czasu.

15
00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.380
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

16
00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.620
Nie mam czasu.

17
00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.260
You are at the post office. Say it.

18
00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:17.320
Jestem na poczcie.

19
00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:21.880
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

20
00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:25.240
Jestem na poczcie.

21
